ENTRY            T0155   20260413   20260819   20260819       C258
SUBENT        T0155001   20260413   20260819   20260819       C258
BIB                 10         21
TITLE      3He and 4He production by 800 MeV protons from 12C,
            Ti, and Pb at forward angles
AUTHOR     (D.B.Barlow, B.M.K.Nefkens, C.Pillai, J.W.Price,
            I.Slaus, M.J.Wang, J.A.Wightman, K.W.Jones,
            M.J.Leitch, C.S.Mishra, C.L.Morris, J.-C.Peng,
            P.K.Teng, J.M.Tinsley)
INSTITUTE  (1USACLA,1USALAS,1USAASU)
           (3CHFCHF) Institute of Physics, Academia Sinica, Nankan
REFERENCE  (J,PR/C,45,293,1992)
FACILITY   (LINAC,1USALAS) LAMPF
METHOD     (TOF)
DETECTOR   (MAGSP)
           (COIN,SCIN,SCIN) Pair of scintillation counters spaced
            ~70 cm apart.
ERR-ANALYS (ERR-S) Statistical uncertainty
           (ERR-1) Absolute calibration of spectrometer (10%)
STATUS     Data taken from tables in reference.
           No reply from D.B. Barlow to author proof.
HISTORY    (20010213T) Converted from data set O0748 compiled by
            CAJaD and updated; data replaced.
           (20260413A) On. Major alterations in 002-007.
ENDBIB              21
COMMON               2          3
EN         ERR-1
MEV        PER-CENT
 800.       10.
ENDCOMMON            3
